     "model": "One cycle lasts 0.8 s, so the heart rate is 60 ÷ 0.8 = 75 beats per minute. Cardiac output = heart rate × stroke volume = 75 × 75 = 5625 cm³ min⁻¹, which is 5.6 dm³ min⁻¹.",
